# The "Camera" button on the desktop (after Terminal, Files, Notes, Web: at
# 364..428, 6..). QEMU has no camera: the window opens and says so, and
# q closes it.
@usb kbd mouse
$ layout us
@screenshot 1920x1080 pixels 366,8=3a6ea5 426,8=3a6ea5
# The pointer starts in the middle (960,540).
@mouse -564 -524
@button left down
@button left up
$ threads
~ camera     (waiting|ready)
$ camera view
camera: no camera plugged in ('lsusb' lists the devices)
